{"version":1,"width":1080,"height":1350,"html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"nl\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"loveke-size\" content=\"1080x1350\">\n<title>Mythe en feit</title>\n<style>/* Loveke Instagram-huisstijl. Lettertypes lokaal (fontsource), geen netwerk nodig. */\n@font-face{font-family:'Lilita One';src:url(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Akke-aigento/loveke/main/marketing/instagram/fonts/lilita-one-latin-400-normal.woff2\") format('woff2');font-weight:400}\n@font-face{font-family:'DM Sans';src:url(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Akke-aigento/loveke/main/marketing/instagram/fonts/dm-sans-latin-400-normal.woff2\") format('woff2');font-weight:400}\n@font-face{font-family:'DM Sans';src:url(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Akke-aigento/loveke/main/marketing/instagram/fonts/dm-sans-latin-600-normal.woff2\") format('woff2');font-weight:600}\n@font-face{font-family:'DM Sans';src:url(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Akke-aigento/loveke/main/marketing/instagram/fonts/dm-sans-latin-700-normal.woff2\") format('woff2');font-weight:700}\n@font-face{font-family:'Caveat';src:url(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Akke-aigento/loveke/main/marketing/instagram/fonts/caveat-latin-600-normal.woff2\") format('woff2');font-weight:600}\n@font-face{font-family:'Caveat';src:url(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Akke-aigento/loveke/main/marketing/instagram/fonts/caveat-latin-700-normal.woff2\") format('woff2');font-weight:700}\n:root{--cream:#FFF8F0;--black:#1A1A1A;--orange:#FF7033;--yellow:#FFD43D;--red:#E3404B;--pink:#FF85A1}\nhtml,body{margin:0;padding:0}\n.wm{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#E3404B 0%,#FF7033 55%,#FFC93D 100%);-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent}\n.dots{background-image:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(26,26,26,.10) 2.5px,transparent 2.5px);background-size:22px 22px}\n/* Plek voor een Instagram-sticker (poll, link, vraag, aftelling): leeg in de export. */\n.slot{visibility:hidden}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div style=\"width: 1080px; height: 1350px; box-sizing: border-box; background: #FFF8F0; position: relative; overflow: hidden; font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; color: #1A1A1A\">\n<div class=\"dots\" style=\"position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; top: 0; height: 600px; opacity: .5\"></div>\n<div style=\"position: absolute; left: 80px; top: 80px; font-family: 'Lilita One', sans-serif; font-size: 54px; letter-spacing: 3px; background: #1A1A1A; color: #FFF8F0; padding: 6px 26px; border-radius: 16px; transform: rotate(-3deg)\">MYTHE</div>\n<div style=\"position: absolute; left: 80px; right: 80px; top: 210px; font-family: 'Lilita One', sans-serif; font-size: 104px; line-height: .98; color: #1A1A1A; opacity: .9\" data-slot=\"mythe\" data-label=\"Mythe\" data-max=\"46\" data-multiline=\"true\">Een Loveke is enkel voor je lief.</div>\n<div style=\"position: absolute; left: 60px; right: 90px; top: 255px; height: 16px; background: #E3404B; border-radius: 8px; transform: rotate(-2deg); box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 #1A1A1A\"></div>\n<div style=\"position: absolute; left: 60px; right: 420px; top: 362px; height: 16px; background: #E3404B; border-radius: 8px; transform: rotate(2deg); box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 #1A1A1A\"></div>\n<div style=\"position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; top: 600px; bottom: 0; background: #E3404B; border-top: 8px solid #1A1A1A\"></div>\n<div class=\"dots\" style=\"position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; top: 608px; bottom: 0; opacity: .35\"></div>\n<div style=\"position: absolute; left: 80px; top: 560px; font-family: 'Lilita One', sans-serif; font-size: 54px; letter-spacing: 3px; background: #FFD43D; border: 6px solid #1A1A1A; padding: 2px 26px; border-radius: 16px; box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 #1A1A1A; transform: rotate(2deg)\">FEIT</div>\n<div style=\"position: absolute; left: 80px; right: 80px; top: 700px; font-family: 'Lilita One', sans-serif; font-size: 104px; line-height: .98; color: #FFF8F0; -webkit-text-stroke: 4px #1A1A1A; text-shadow: 8px 8px 0 #1A1A1A\" data-slot=\"feit\" data-label=\"Feit\" data-max=\"56\" data-multiline=\"true\">Een Loveke is iedereen die je graag ziet.</div>\n<div style=\"position: absolute; left: 80px; right: 80px; top: 1050px; font-family: 'Caveat', cursive; font-weight: 700; font-size: 62px; line-height: 1.05; color: #1A1A1A; transform: rotate(-1.5deg)\" data-slot=\"onderregel\" data-label=\"Onderregel\" data-max=\"70\" data-multiline=\"true\">je lief, je beste maat, je mama, en de kleinste thuis.</div>\n<div class=\"wm\" style=\"position: absolute; right: 70px; bottom: 46px; font-family: 'Lilita One', sans-serif; font-size: 60px; background: #1A1A1A; -webkit-background-clip: initial; background-clip: initial; color: #FFF8F0; padding: 4px 22px; border-radius: 16px\">Loveke</div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}